# PAM service used by tsconfig (app/auth/pam_auth.py) to verify the operator's
# (pi's) password for the web login and BLE login. tsconfig runs as pi;
# pam_unix checks the caller's own password through its setuid unix_chkpwd
# helper, so no root access is needed. tsconfig-ble runs as its own user in
# the shadow group (for its hash login), so pam_unix reads shadow directly. No nullok: an empty
# password never authenticates. (Only pi is checked through this service; the
# staff root login goes through su instead - see app/auth/pam_auth.py.)
auth    required    pam_unix.so
account required    pam_unix.so
